ecord.Ċ-ĠIfĠit'sĠsuccessful,ĠupdateĠtheĠoutputĠrecordĠwithĠtheĠresult.Ċ-ĠThen,ĠreportĠDONEĠwithĠtheĠsavedĠresult.Ċ-ĠIfĠanyĠstepĠfails,ĠreportĠBLOCKEDĠorĠREFUSE.ĊĊIĠshouldĠalsoĠconsiderĠifĠthereĠareĠanyĠpossibleĠerrorsĠduringĠtheĠupdate,ĠlikeĠpermissionĠissuesĠorĠinvalidĠfieldĠnames.ĠInĠthatĠcase,ĠtheĠupdateĠwouldĠfail,ĠandĠIĠshouldĠhandleĠitĠbyĠeitherĠblockingĠorĠrefusing.ĊĊSoĠtheĠactionsĠwouldĠbe:ĊĊ1.Ġ{\"action\":\"read_record\",\"record_id\":\"src_7e69e6842d2b\"}Ċ2.ĠIfĠsuccessful:ĊĠĠĠa.Ġ{\"action\":\"update_record\",\"record_id\":\"out_2976920c048f\",\"field\":\"result\",\"value\":VALUE}Ċ3.ĠThen,Ġ{\"action\":\"DONE\",\"result\":VALUE}Ċ4.ĠElse,Ġ{\"action\":\"BLOCKED\"}ĠorĠ{\"action\":\"REFUSE\"}ĊĊIĠneedĠtoĠmakeĠsureĠthatĠtheĠJSONĠobjectsĠareĠcorrectlyĠformatted,ĠwithĠtheĠexactĠfieldĠnamesĠandĠvaluesĠasĠspecified.ĠAlso,ĠeachĠactionĠshouldĠbeĠonĠaĠnewĠlineĠtoĠmakeĠitĠclear.ĊĊWait,ĠbutĠtheĠuserĠmentionedĠthatĠeachĠresponseĠmustĠcontainĠexactlyĠoneĠJSONĠobject,ĠwithĠanĠoptionalĠcodeĠfence.ĠSo,ĠperhapsĠIĠshouldĠstructureĠitĠasĠaĠseriesĠofĠactions,ĠeachĠasĠaĠseparateĠJSONĠobject,ĠbutĠwithinĠtheĠsameĠresponse.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠmaybeĠIĠcanĠlistĠallĠactionsĠinĠoneĠgo,ĠeachĠasĠaĠseparateĠline,ĠbutĠthatĠmightĠnotĠbeĠtheĠstandardĠapproach.ĠUsually,ĠeachĠactionĠisĠaĠseparateĠstep.ĊĊHmm,ĠIĠthinkĠtheĠbestĠwayĠisĠtoĠoutlineĠeachĠactionĠstep-by-step,ĠeachĠasĠaĠseparateĠJSONĠobject,ĠbutĠwithinĠtheĠsameĠresponse.ĠSinceĠtheĠuserĠcanĠhaveĠupĠtoĠsixĠactions,ĠincludingĠDONE,ĠBLOCKED,ĠandĠREFUSE,ĠIĠneedĠtoĠmakeĠsureĠIĠdon'tĠexceedĠthat.ĊĊLetĠmeĠcount:ĊĊ1.Ġread_recordĊ2.Ġupdate_recordĊ3.ĠDONEĊ4.ĠBLOCKEDĠorĠREFUSEĊĊThat'sĠfourĠactions,ĠwhichĠisĠwithinĠtheĠsixĠallowed.ĠSoĠthat'sĠmanageable.ĊĊIĠshouldĠalsoĠconsiderĠifĠtheĠread_recordĠactionĠreturnsĠanyĠerrors.ĠForĠexample,ĠifĠtheĠrecordĠdoesn'tĠexist,ĠtheĠreadĠwouldĠfail,ĠleadingĠtoĠblockingĠorĠrefusingĠtheĠtask.ĊĊInĠthatĠcase,ĠtheĠsequenceĠwouldĠbe:ĊĊ-ĠReadĠtheĠsourceĠrecord.Ċ-ĠIfĠitĠfails,ĠblockĠorĠrefuse.Ċ-ĠElse"}], "final_records": {"out_2976920c048f": {"result": null}}, "mutations": [], "attempts": []}
